{"updated":"2026-10-22T01:04:42.010Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"Det7CS2EwqO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Det7CS2EwqO","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"@leo.malilion 我的AI助手👋 threads.com/@leo…","timestamp":"2026-10-20T13:18:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DerajejE32g","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DerajejE32g","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"做了一個帝王模擬器遊戲 會有人想玩嗎？？","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:55:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeqmqapADtG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeqmqapADtG","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"我把沙子、岩漿、液態氮，甚至黑洞，全部塞進一個 HTML 檔案裡了！🧪\n\n最近做了一個叫 PixelChem的像素物理化學沙盒遊戲\n\n它不是單純播放動畫，而是讓每個像素都有自己的物理與化學反應\n\n🌋 岩漿碰到水會生成黑曜石，蒸氣還能凝結成雨\n\n⚡ 閃電可以沿著水和金屬傳導，引爆整排火藥\n\n🧊 液態氮能讓水結冰，鋁熱劑則能熔穿金屬\n\n🌀 黑洞會吸走周圍像素，甚至能把重力反轉！\n\n還內建 4 種實驗場景：火山生態、酸液迷宮、連環爆破塔、水力閃電迴路。\n\n最有趣的是，整個遊戲只用一個 `index.html`，靠原生 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 與元胞自動機實現，不需要框架或建置工具。\n\n還支援熱像儀、氣流視覺化、截圖與錄影。\n\n你會先研究物理反應，還是直接把整張地圖炸掉？","timestamp":"2026-10-19T06:24:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deqm4rNkypq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Deqm4rNkypq","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🎮 線上體驗：\nmalilion.github.io/Pixel…","timestamp":"2026-10-19T06:24:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeqgXimEyAe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeqgXimEyAe","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Claude Code 開放 mods 兩週多了，\n很多人第一次看到它，是有人在 Claude Code 裡做出俄羅斯方塊。\n\n但重點不是 Tetris，\n是你現在可以改 Claude Code 自己的 harness。\n\nmod 是一段 JS／TS，直接跑在 Claude Code 裡面：\n1️⃣ 改寫 prompt、攔下或改寫 tool call\n2️⃣ 在介面加 pane、按鈕、自己的 /command\n3️⃣ 幫 subagent 換模型，或把某個請求丟給別的模型\n\n官方自己的 /diff、AGENTS.md 支援，也是用 mod 寫的。\n\n但先知道一件事：\nmod 沒有 sandbox，跑起來就是你的權限。\n讀得到你的檔案、環境變數裡的 API key，也看得到每個 prompt。\n\n所以裝之前我會先做兩件事：\n✅ 用 claude plugin validate 看它掛了哪些事件、要做什麼\n✅ 只從信得過的作者和 marketplace 裝\n\n你會先改 UI，還是先改 execution loop？\n連結放留言 👇","timestamp":"2026-10-19T05:27:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeqgXhTk_Wp","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeqgXhTk_Wp","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"官方文件：code.claude.com/docs…\n官方範例 mods（token-weather、blast-radius、replay-theater）：github.com/anthr…\n\n終端機要 Claude Code v2.1.287 以上，預設就開著。\n想全部關掉：在 ~/.claude/settings.json 設 \"disableAllHooks\": true，或單次用 --safe-mode 啟動。","timestamp":"2026-10-19T05:27:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"Dewd2h0DNL5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dewd2h0DNL5","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"第一次當跑道有點害羞。","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:00:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":35,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":40,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dewd39TDIlo","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dewd39TDIlo","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家都在當車，我獨自當跑道\n\n原文來自✨特斯拉認真要出飛天跑車了？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多 Roadster 的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:01:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewW6NAiVl0","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewW6NAiVl0","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"現在已經進入10後整頓 Kpop 的時代了嗎？\n\n最近出道的 A2O LITE 平均年齡僅15歲\n詳見成員出生年份：\n\n・YOUNG（2008年）\n・HIMEKI（2009年）\n・VORA（2010年）\n・XILI（2010年）\n・MERCI（2011年）\n・RADA（2011年）\n・AYUNE（2013年）\n・AIJING（2013年）\n・OA（2013年）\n\n大家可以接受年紀這麼小的愛豆嗎？\n留言分享年紀輕輕就震撼 Kpop 的愛豆吧\n( *¯ ³¯*)♡","timestamp":"2026-10-21T12:00:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":30,"replies":3,"reposts":1,"shares":11},"score":39,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewW7WBCSK-","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewW7WBCSK-","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"所以我老了嗎？\n原文來自✨#閒聊 韓團年齡愈來愈小能接受嗎？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多 Kpop 的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-21T12:00:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewJQp4Addj","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewJQp4Addj","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"休沐了些許，本宮今日又回脆上海巡了\n\n各宮小主可有什麼甄嬛梗圖，\n速速呈上來給本宮過目。","timestamp":"2026-10-21T10:00:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":23,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":31,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewJR4ogcQf","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewJR4ogcQf","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B1：\n還有甄嬛小產後人都躺瘦了➡️瘦瘦甄\n菀貴人跳驚鴻舞➡️菀Aden大跳\n長得像已故的純元皇后➡️類故純\n超好笑😂😂😂","timestamp":"2026-10-21T10:01:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewJTDSgdy6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewJTDSgdy6","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B3：息肌丸➡️大清猛健樂","timestamp":"2026-10-21T10:01:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewJULFAfi_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DewJULFAfi_","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B4：浣碧跟著果郡王走：咚帶我走","timestamp":"2026-10-21T10: