st_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewF0uLlCR4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DewF0uLlCR4","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-21T09:30:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Devx53mlCC5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Devx53mlCC5","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"ChatGPT 的私人聊天不想留在一般紀錄裡？新「鎖定對話」可移出聊天紀錄與搜尋，以 PIN 解鎖，支援的手機也能用生物辨識。免費方案也在分批推送，哪些對話能鎖、換裝置又有哪些限制？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-21T06:36:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Devx6d7FN16","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Devx6d7FN16","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-21T06:36:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DevcieBlNdD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DevcieBlNdD","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-21T03:30:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Devch7pFJxi","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Devch7pFJxi","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"汽車原理不用只啃手冊！Electude 把機械構造與電池管理做成 3D 動畫、互動課程和模擬診斷。展示模組可免費體驗，完整平台則是商業教育軟體，原站未支援中文；哪些內容適合先試玩？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-21T03:30:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DewmI-dD17w","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DewmI-dD17w","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"組裝傢俱再也不是冷冰冰的平面說明書\n一直在思考 AI 做 3D 動畫有哪些實用的場景\n\n於是把 Ikea 的某個傢俱說明書丟進去\n請他產生 3D 的組裝教學影片\n給覺得看說明書組裝傢俱很痛苦的人看看\n\n老闆們也能思考看看\n手上的產品影片如何用類似的方法來呈現","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:17:08.000Z","stats":{"likes":16,"replies":7,"reposts":0,"shares":3},"score":30,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DewMXjZnwfZ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DewMXjZnwfZ","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"笑死 GrokBot 的 server 果然有夠大\n拿來裝 n8n 也是綽綽有餘\n\n但 GrokBot 不是 n8n 一個好的部署歸屬\n\nGrokBot 只要閒置數分鐘就會讓電腦休眠\n所以 n8n 也會跟著失去作用\n最短的排程也無法讓主機保持 100% 在線\n\n但讓 GrokBot 可以調用 Claude, Codex, Gemini \n可以緩解一些 token 焦慮","timestamp":"2026-10-21T10:28:08.000Z","stats":{"likes":25,"replies":10,"reposts":1,"shares":2},"score":48,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DevguaMkej-","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DevguaMkej-","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"把 Grok Bot 訂閱回來玩玩看\n\n其實你不用手動自己建立 Bot\n聊一聊根據場景需要\n\n你直接請 Main Agent 幫你建立一個新的 Agent 就好\n要做網頁 -> 設計師 bot\n要寫程式 -> 工程師 bot\n整理 Gmail -> G家整理師 bot\n\n對於沒有建立過 AI Agent 或是新手\n這流程一定會覺得超級順暢，幾乎沒什麼阻力\n\n對我來說反而有點焦慮\n畫面上呈現資訊太少\n現在用什麼模型、消耗多少 token、Context 已經塞多少\n\n來研究研究怎麼弄出個 statusline = =","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:06:47.000Z","stats":{"likes":32,"replies":10,"reposts":0,"shares":6},"score":52,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Des7xeKkdSQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Des7xeKkdSQ","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"請大家告訴大家\n如果你的 Claude 還有重置券\n即將於 10/23 後到期\n\n一定要使用！\nClaude 的重置券非常珍貴\n\n另外提醒 Claude 的重置是不會重設時間的\n\n例如我週日本來就是 weekly limit reset\n假設我在明天使用重置卷\n就必須要在三天左右的時間燒完 weekly limit \n不然禮拜天就又 reset 了","timestamp":"2026-10-20T04:05:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":95,"replies":18,"reposts":4,"shares":75},"score":143,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[{"id":"Deq8brJmrzw","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ironv.careerlife/post/Deq8brJmrzw","username":"ironv.careerlife","displayName":"ironv.careerlife","content":"最近遇上 zeabur 準備關閉服務，想了解如何轉移的朋友，可以參考一下 Darrell 最新文章！  Translate\n\nReplying to @darrell_tw_","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:32:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deq7p7qGihT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ironv.careerlife/post/Deq7p7qGihT","username":"ironv.careerlife","displayName":"ironv.careerlife","content":"剛剛看到 Vincent 新課程6000，創始會員直接賺爛，11/05 課程就火速上架，\n\n其實不用額外贈送，當初也準備刷，沒想到加入會員來能獲得這樣回饋，根本佛心企業。不知道另外3堂直播實戰是可以觀看還是加價購🤔\n\n之前訂閱曼報 pro ，有了孩子之後很難空出時間閱讀，推出 podcast 之後，洗小孩餵奶無痛學習，讓小孩可以提早接觸財金知識😆\n\n不知道以後會不會開發出幼兒財經，成為國民必備育兒教材","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:25:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":224,"replies":7,"reposts":1,"shares":20},"score":241,"first_seen":"2026-10-22T01:49:59+08:00","latest":true}]}]}